### Get all preparation tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Add a preparation task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Java Collections",
  "category": "Java",
  "completed": false
}


### Get all company applications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

### Add a company application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "TCS",
  "jobRole": "Java Developer",
  "applicationDate": "2026-10-23",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "jobLink": "https://www.tcs.com/careers",
  "notes": "Practice Java and DSA"
}
